## Built-in Commands

JRebirth provides several ready-to-use commands:

| Command | Purpose | Thread |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `ShowModelCommand` | Display a model's view (prepare + attach) | JIT → JTP → JAT |
| `ShowFadingModelCommand` | Show with fade transition | JIT → JTP → JAT |
| `FadeInOutCommand` | Fade a node in or out | JAT |
| `ChainWaveCommand` | Execute a list of waves sequentially | JIT |
| `AttachModelCommand` | Attach a model's node to a parent | JAT |
| `DetachModelCommand` | Remove a model's node from parent | JAT |
| `PrepareModelCommand` | Build model's view off-screen | JTP |

